This extension adds Nobody Wants to Die modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with a "'.pak" file to the "detnoir\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a top-level folder such as "detnoir" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

